  },
  "consumed": "Spice Primary",
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 2eb (Dirt Cheap)<br>\n<strong>Vendor:</strong> Dr. Feelgood/Open Market</p>\n<p>Drug. Smoked, Inhaled, or Injested. Cannbinoids, either organic or synthetic. A single dose is equal is the size of one joint, a few puffs of a vape, or a single gummy.</p>\n<p>Primary Effect: Lasts 4 hours. For the duration the user suffers a -2 to all INT-based skill checks and Concentration checks. Gain +1 COOL.</p>\n<p>Secondary Effects (DV 13): User becomes addicted to Spice and takes a -1 penalty to all INT-based skill checks and Concentration checks unless you are experiencing the Primary Effect.</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Using the drug turns on \"Spice Primary\": -2 to every INT skill and to Concentration, +1 COOL.</li>\n<li>While addicted, switch on \"Spice Addiction\". When an addicted character doses, use \"Spice Addicted Primary\" instead of the normal primary effect; it cancels the addiction penalty for the duration.</li>\n<li>Durations are not automated.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From Bontari Homebrew Cyberpunk Items by Bontari (Drugs).</em></p>"
  },
  "equipped": "owned",
  "favorite": false,
  "price": {
   "market": 2
  },
